  "note": "Index of every reusable art file in this library. Paths are relative to assets/data/. Scenery svgs are standalone files with viewBox='0 0 100 100' preserveAspectRatio='none', drawn so the bottom third stays clear for characters standing in front of them. 'night: true' means the art is already a night scene, so the loader does not add its dark overlay. 'fx' entries are 64\u00d764 particle sprites on a transparent background, meant to be rasterized to a texture (Assets.fxTexture) and drawn with additive blending by a 3D effects layer. 'ui' entries are the themed interface art used by prototypes (frames, ornaments, HUD/tab/slot/stat icons, rarity gems): the ones drawn with fill='currentColor' are meant to be used as a CSS mask-image so they take the surrounding text colour, the rest as plain backgrounds or <img> tags.",
